  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">학년말에 유튜브 영상 시청하는데요.<br>영상만 시청하기에는 왠지 아쉽죠?<br>&#160;<br>그래서 챗GPT에게 문제를 만들어 달라고 했습니다.<br>&#160;<br>1. 원하는 유튜브 영상 클릭<br>2. 영상 아래 &#39;더보기&#39; 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d1df6648e49976055eda880b9e33d49f833edc7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d1df6648e49976055eda880b9e33d49f833edc7\" data-origin-width=\"315\" data-origin-height=\"205\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>3. 스크립트 - 스크립트 표시&#160; 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34a418bfc2e6ef8f9499e9cb4314773c60cafffe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34a418bfc2e6ef8f9499e9cb4314773c60cafffe\" data-origin-width=\"222\" data-origin-height=\"123\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>4. 화면 오른쪽에 스크립트가 나오고 전체를 블럭설정하여 복사하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1db5524a8029c3473904b724a96d2c8a71084000\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1db5524a8029c3473904b724a96d2c8a71084000\" data-origin-width=\"416\" data-origin-height=\"500\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>5. 복사한 스크립트를 챗GPT에 붙이기<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>6.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49b7d1e445ece4fb8cddfca99ccf06947da98dae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49b7d1e445ece4fb8cddfca99ccf06947da98dae\" data-origin-width=\"563\" data-origin-height=\"90\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">7.&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb0065a5b69cbae9d9f234562c780ecdda2c8d44\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"612\" height=\"193\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb0065a5b69cbae9d9f234562c780ecdda2c8d44\" data-origin-width=\"789\" data-origin-height=\"249\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">8.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/709e6ef58932d3872a0bb74ae67777cfc0ad4c36\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"583\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/709e6ef58932d3872a0bb74ae67777cfc0ad4c36\" data-origin-width=\"817\" data-origin-height=\"172\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e212f43d7585291570310d8b5f8cd0ab50b6a620\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"551\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e212f43d7585291570310d8b5f8cd0ab50b6a620\" data-origin-width=\"732\" data-origin-height=\"247\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>9. 이제 교사를 위한 답을 만듭니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dbcb6a99ec0464afce39395c8fa442f316ba2f9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"498\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dbcb6a99ec0464afce39395c8fa442f316ba2f9\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"397\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>드디어 완성되었습니다!<br>&#160;<br>해당 영상은&#160;<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2Tpe18CLq0\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2Tpe18CLq0</a></p><d